      "text": "The audit flagged a **temporal leakage** issue: random cross\u2011validation mixed early and later\u202f\u2018signup_month\u2019 records, giving an inflated AUC of\u202f0.706 versus the true 0.571 for the last\u202f30\u202f% of data (gap\u202f0.134). This leakage lets the model \u201cpeek\u201d at future information during training, making its scores look better than they really are. We resolved it by switching to a **forward\u2011chaining (temporal) evaluation** that only trains on earlier months and tests on later months. All other checks (proxy feature, exact/near duplicates, group leakage) were clean, so the final plan uses temporal CV with no rows removed.",
